    <string name="health_privacy_title">Health Connect – Privacy</string>
    <string name="health_privacy_heading">Use of health data</string>
    <string name="health_privacy_text">ScaleLauncher processes Xiaomi S400 measurement data locally on the device. You can choose which supported values – weight, body fat, body water, bone mass, lean body mass, and basal metabolic rate – are written to Health Connect. For the BMI option, weight and height are transferred because Health Connect does not provide a dedicated BMI data type.

The app does not read health data from Health Connect, has no internet access, and does not transmit data to Xiaomi or any other server. Permissions can be revoked at any time in the Health Connect settings.</string>
